The game ended in GAME_OVER on level 5. I reached level 5, having beaten levels 1–4, and did not beat the game.

This attempt I played the cheapest route my model found, exactly as planned:
- opened switch C;
- collected the energy refill;
- shrank the piece, climbed the narrow passage and grew it back;
- opened switch D;
- teleported into the goal corridor.

Every step matched the model. Energy ran out with the piece at (9,33), two moves short of the goal box.

